---
fiscal_year_starts: july
---

# FY2025 Budget: Quarterly Engineering Spend

An Australian SaaS company allocates its annual engineering budget across fiscal quarters. The fiscal year runs July 2024 through June 2025 — a period that includes the Feb 29 2024 leap day in FQ3.

Because each fiscal quarter has a different number of calendar days, the daily run rate varies even when the quarterly budget is flat. This matters for cash flow forecasting, contractor planning, and mid-quarter reforecasts.

## Annual Budget

annual_eng_budget = $4,800,000
quarterly_budget = $4,800,000 / 4

## Fiscal Quarter Boundaries

FQ1 starts July 1. Each quarter is three months, but not all months are equal.

fq1_start = Jul 1 2024
fq1_end = Oct 1 2024
fq1_days = Oct 1 2024 - Jul 1 2024

fq2_start = Oct 1 2024
fq2_end = Jan 1 2025
fq2_days = Jan 1 2025 - Oct 1 2024

fq3_start = Jan 1 2025
fq3_end = Apr 1 2025
fq3_days = Apr 1 2025 - Jan 1 2025

fq4_start = Apr 1 2025
fq4_end = Jul 1 2025
fq4_days = Jul 1 2025 - Apr 1 2025

## Daily Run Rates

With a flat $1.2M per quarter, the daily cost varies by quarter length. FQ3 includes February — a shorter month, and in FY2024 it was a leap year February.

fq1_daily = $1,200,000 / 92
fq2_daily = $1,200,000 / 92
fq3_daily = $1,200,000 / 90
fq4_daily = $1,200,000 / 91

## Leap Year Impact

The previous FY2024 had FQ3 spanning Jan-Mar 2024 with a leap day. Compare the two:

fy24_fq3_days = Apr 1 2024 - Jan 1 2024
fy25_fq3_days = Apr 1 2025 - Jan 1 2025
leap_day_difference = Apr 1 2024 - Jan 1 2024 - (Apr 1 2025 - Jan 1 2025)

## Mid-Quarter Reforecast

It is Oct 15 2024. FQ2 is 14 days in. How much budget remains?

fq2_elapsed = Oct 15 2024 - Oct 1 2024
fq2_spent = $1,200,000 / 92 * 14
fq2_remaining = $1,200,000 - $1,200,000 / 92 * 14

## Contractor Ramp Timeline

A new contractor team starts Jan 15 2025 (mid-FQ3) and ramps to full capacity by Mar 1 2025 — a 45-day ramp.

contractor_start = Jan 15 2025
full_capacity = Jan 15 2025 + 45 days
ramp_in_fq3 = Apr 1 2025 - (Jan 15 2025 + 45 days)
contractor_monthly = $15,000
ramp_months = 1.5
ramp_cost = $15,000 * 1.5
full_rate_days = Apr 1 2025 - (Jan 15 2025 + 45 days)

## Key Dates

board_review = Jan 15 2025 + 3 months
fiscal_year_end = Jul 1 2025 - 1 day
budget_lock = Jul 1 2025 - 2 weeks
